@step Create the second quarter's work unit so a different filing target exists.
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work create --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 2T
@capture another_work_unit_id result.work_unit_id
@step Address a different visible target, such as another period.
aeat --format json app modelo work status --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 2T
@step Or address a different work unit by its reference number.
@result aeat --format json app modelo work status {another_work_unit_id}
@expect result.period.code == "2T"
@expect exit_code == 0
